# Language: English

Autorig Tools product surface is English-only unless the user explicitly
asks for i18n. Chat replies to the user are Spanish. See `chat-language.mdc`.
This file is only for the product (Maya UI, docs, logs), not for Cursor chat.

- New Maya menu labels, window titles, placeholders, empty states: English
- `how_it_works.md`, comments, agent/terminal output: English, ASCII (no accents, no emoji)
- Do not bulk-rewrite existing Spanish `inViewMessage` strings unless asked

Do not add Spanish (or other languages) to new UI unless the user
explicitly asks for i18n.

Technical identifiers stay as they are: module names, menu ids, env keys.
